<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Simulated ~30-minute highway drive on I-70 east of Denver (Denver -> Bennett, CO).
  Timestamps are spaced 90s per ~2.7 km leg (~105 km/h) so Xcode simulates realistic
  highway movement. Use via Simulator: Features > Location > Custom Location, or in
  Xcode: Debug > Simulate Location > Add GPX File to Workspace, or attach to the
  scheme's Run options (Core Location > Default Location).
  Not part of the app target; developer tooling only.
-->
